*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Report Y182R001_ASSIGNMENTS1
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
REPORT y182r001_assignments1.

*Print the All/Even/Odd numbers from a series of numbers.
*Input Parameter: Take from and to number
*Radio button : All, Even, Odd
*
*Validation : ‘From’ number should be <  ‘To’ Number
*
*Logic:  Generate Numbers as per input given in range of ‘from’ and ‘to’.
*
*Output  : Print numbers as per the radio button.

DATA: gv_num1 TYPE i.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-001.
  PARAMETERS: p_num1 TYPE i,
              p_num2 TYPE i.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-002.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    PARAMETERS: rb_all RADIOBUTTON GROUP g1 USER-COMMAND ucl DEFAULT 'X'.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (08) TEXT-001.
    PARAMETERS: rb_even RADIOBUTTON GROUP g1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (08) TEXT-002.
    PARAMETERS: rb_odd RADIOBUTTON GROUP g1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (08) TEXT-003.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END OF LINE.

SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b2.

* ADD VAlidation of the Correct User Input
AT SELECTION-SCREEN.

  IF p_num1 >= p_num2.
    MESSAGE 'Give the First Number Less Than Second Number' TYPE 'E' DISPLAY LIKE 'I'.
  ENDIF.
*END SELECTION-SCREEN.

START-OF-SELECTION.
  DO.

    IF p_num1 > p_num2.
      EXIT.
    ENDIF.

    IF rb_all = 'X'.
      WRITE: / p_num1.

    ELSEIF rb_even = 'X'.

      IF p_num1 MOD 2 = 0.
        WRITE: / p_num1.
      ENDIF.

    ELSEIF rb_odd = 'X'.

      IF p_num1 MOD 2 <> 0.
        WRITE: / p_num1.
      ENDIF.

    ENDIF.

    p_num1 = p_num1 + 1.

  ENDDO.


*ENDIF.
END-OF-SELECTION.